{"lines":[{"t":"Test 3","x":0.89484536189819208,"y":0.040697674325348543,"w":0.063917522430419926,"h":0.01453488361674482,"c":1},{"t":"The auditorium itself seats 1500 people. The floor's supported by ten massive pads.","x":0.063917525487920041,"y":0.085731062825931015,"c":1,"w":0.7154639180501301,"h":0.01614797416324143},{"w":0.75463918050130208,"x":0.06391752309921192,"y":0.10174418609553793,"t":"These are constructed from rubber, and so are able to absorb any vibrations from outside","h":0.01453488361674482,"c":1},{"c":1,"y":0.11773255818927564,"w":0.7402061971028645,"h":0.014680829946951413,"x":0.063917519918857593,"t":"and prevent them from affecting the auditorium. The walls are made of several layers of"},{"x":0.061855672487828223,"t":"honey-coloured wood, all sourced from local beech trees. In order to improve the acoustic","y":0.13358778603360577,"w":0.76082473754882818,"h":0.014679976512037674,"c":1},{"x":0.063853804018371818,"h":0.01848060890148473,"c":1,"t":"properties of the auditorium and to amplify the sound, they are not straight, they are curved.","w":0.77535715738932287,"y":0.14821489199047844},{"t":"The acoustics are also adjustable according to the size of orchestra and the type of music","h":0.016894034196962338,"x":0.063874651572397079,"y":0.1655639974773746,"w":0.75885737101236983,"c":1},{"x":0.061855673669117171,"w":0.78350514729817711,"c":1,"t":"being played. In order to achieve this, there are nine movable panels in the ceiling above the","h":0.01453488361674482,"y":0.18313953493386526},{"t":"orchestra which are all individually motorized, and the walls also have cudains which can be.","y":0.19759248397976714,"h":0.016147974163241319,"c":1,"x":0.063917522537449728,"w":0.78556701660156247},{"h":0.01453488361674482,"w":0.35670102437337242,"y":0.2151162791168133,"t":"opened or closed to change the acoustics.","c":1,"x":0.063917528963800596},{"h":0.017854859670749845,"c":1,"w":0.74653788248697917,"t":"The reaction of the public to the new building has generally been positive. However the.","x":0.063852800993570047,"y":0.23653174745601924},{"x":0.063855546661280863,"y":0.25248065757870286,"w":0.79186960856119792,"t":"evaluation of some critics has been less enthusiastic. In spite of Harrison's effons to use local","h":0.016821647348364666,"c":1},{"c":1,"x":0.063917516240232342,"t":"materials, they criticise the style ofthe design as being international rather than local, and","w":0.75670104980468744,"y":0.27034883725837955,"h":0.014534883616744709},{"t":"say it doesn't reflect features of the landscape or society for which it is built.","w":0.64123713175455732,"x":0.061855660827369499,"h":0.01614797416324143,"c":1,"y":0.28625954185169611},{"x":0.863917526489411,"w":0.039175256093343158,"h":0.013081395479069058,"c":1,"y":0.23837209291966521,"t":"Q40"},{"h":0.027871022697623427,"y":0.33998890702617701,"w":0.11146705627441406,"t":"TEST 3","x":0.39993657516282116,"c":1},{"w":0.15876288096110025,"t":"SECTION 1","h":0.014679976512037674,"c":1,"y":0.40986494428453846,"x":0.06185567281841893},{"x":0.061855670008555422,"c":1,"w":0.59999999999999998,"t":"MARTIN: Good morning. This is Burnham tourist office, Martin speaking.","h":0.013211978860833806,"y":0.43893129787651097},{"c":1,"x":0.061855670599414957,"h":0.010174418083723991,"t":"SUE:","y":0.45784883743585114,"w":0.03298968950907389},{"w":0.72371134440104157,"h":0.015991786054072588,"c":1,"x":0.12989690501597398,"t":"Oh, hello. I saw a poster about free things to do in the area, and it said people should","y":0.45494186063212694},{"c":1,"h":0.014534883616744709,"t":"phone you for information. I'm coming to Burnham with my husband and two children","x":0.12783504934305928,"y":0.47093023260803002,"w":0.72371134440104168},{"x":0.1278350517029162,"y":0.48678802087621986,"h":0.01614797416324143,"w":0.68453608194986981,"c":1,"t":"for a few days on June the 27th, or possibly the 28th, and Id like some ideas for"},{"y":0.50290697661366313,"h":0.013081395479069058,"x":0.1298969064586144,"t":"things to do on the 29th.","w":0.20618556976318358,"c":1},{"w":0.05784931182861329,"t":"MARTIN:","x":0.061796993705696496,"y":0.52018106733925362,"c":1,"h":0.010509958004013442},{"h":0.014679976512037562,"c":1,"x":0.12989690553483701,"t":"Yes, of course. OK. Then let's start with a couple of events especially for children.","y":0.51879036967266645,"w":0.69278350830078128},{"t":"The art gallery is holding an event called 'Family Welcome' that day, when there are","x":0.12989690195935993,"w":0.70927836100260411,"h":0.015988371754420583,"y":0.53343023271692225,"c":1},{"h":0.014679976512037562,"t":"activities and trails to use throughout the gallery.","x":0.12989690527578251,"w":0.40824742635091144,"c":1,"y":0.5507927185842183},{"w":0.035051546096801757,"y":0.56831395326451939,"x":0.059793814470008554,"h":0.011627907341393184,"c":1,"t":"SUE:"},{"h":0.01453488361674482,"c":1,"t":"That sounds interesting. What time does it start?","y":0.56686046516471977,"w":0.41237113952636717,"x":0.12989690436000964},{"w":0.68058385213216144,"h":0.019059815689597692,"y":0.58050040053725216,"c":1,"t":"The gallery opens at 10, and the 'Family Welcome' event runs from 10.30 until 2","x":0.12982582437923063},{"y":0.59883720935185925,"h":0.01453488361674482,"x":0.1298968955855338,"w":0.68041239420572919,"c":1,"t":"o'clock. The gallery stays open until 5. And several times during the day, they re"},{"x":0.86391752624378326,"t":"Q1","y":0.57994186033552297,"w":0.026804122924804608,"c":1,"h":0.01453488361674482},{"c":1,"t":"Q2","w":0.028865979512532558,"x":0.86185566983136253,"h":0.013081395479068947,"y":0.59738372073430268},{"t":"going to show a short film that the gallery has produced. It demonstrates now.","y":0.6147974165287865,"x":0.1298968992830504,"h":0.016147974163241319,"c":1,"w":0.66391754150390625},{"h":0.014534883616744709,"w":0.71958760579427083,"c":1,"x":0.1298969186631993,"t":"ceramics are made, and there ll be equipment and materials for children to have a go","y":0.63081395353748637},{"h":0.014679976512037562,"c":1,"t":"themselves. Last time they ran the event, there was a film about painting, which went","w":0.72371134440104168,"x":0.12783504933546416,"y":0.64679976532645411},{"c":1,"h":0.014679976512037562,"w":0.69690719604492191,"t":"down very well with the children, and they're now working on one about sculpture.","y":0.66265413973751441,"x":0.12783506168114722},{"t":"SUE:","w":0.035051546096801757,"y":0.68168604662373666,"x":0.059793814470008554,"h":0.0087209299460482281,"c":1},{"h":0.0087209299460482281,"y":0.71366279081185968,"w":0.035051546096801764,"t":"SUE:","c":1,"x":0.059793814477372323},{"c":1,"y":0.67877906969991242,"w":0.57113403320312495,"t":"I like the sound of that. And what other events happen in Burnham?","x":0.12989690082340039,"h":0.013081395479068947},{"t":"MARTIN: Well, do you all enjoy listening to music?","h":0.014679976512037562,"y":0.69465648864942575,"c":1,"x":0.059793817496533376,"w":0.41443298339843748},{"h":0.01453488361674482,"c":1,"w":0.076288661956787129,"x":0.12783505013688293,"y":0.71075581393951337,"t":"Oh, yes."},{"t":"MARTIN: Well there are several free concerts taking place at different times - one or two in the","x":0.059793822986201332,"c":1,"h":0.013211978860833917,"y":0.72665883744804538,"w":0.78969070434570321},{"w":0.76308837890625003,"h":0.018987569400162441,"y":0.74042755635075064,"x":0.1277414548605075,"c":1,"t":"morning, the majority at lunchtime, and a couple in the evening. And they range from Q3"},{"c":1,"y":0.75767229967600336,"t":"pop music to Latin American.","h":0.014180468448945827,"w":0.2476500701904297,"x":0.12980730287965039},{"y":0.77470930237424607,"w":0.43917526245117189,"h":0.01453488361674482,"c":1,"t":"The Latin American could be fun. What time is that?","x":0.12989690475428176},{"w":0.72577321370442704,"c":1,"h":0.013211978860833917,"t":"It's being repeated several times, in different places. They re performing in the central","x":0.12783504251821987,"y":0.79066353471483319},{"w":0.68247421264648434,"h":0.015988371754420694,"x":0.12783505852116994,"y":0.80668604667847699,"t":"library at 1 o clock, then at 4 its in the City Museum, and in the evening, at 7.30,","c":1},{"h":0.013081395479068947,"w":0.030927836100260397,"x":0.86185566948423398,"y":0.80668604639200625,"c":1,"t":"Q4"},{"x":0.12989690405611848,"t":"there's a longer concert, in the theatre.","w":0.32783505757649739,"y":0.82266588362252036,"h":0.013211978860833806,"c":1},{"t":"SUE:","w":0.032989689509073897,"h":0.010174418083723991,"c":1,"x":0.059793815245463053,"y":0.84011627916065734},{"h":0.014679976512037562,"c":1,"x":0.12783504737547796,"t":"Right. I'll suggest that to the rest of the family.","y":0.83852025815513298,"w":0.38969072977701819},{"h":0.0088791094033493501,"t":"MARTIN:","y":0.85747904993241286,"c":1,"w":0.053659667968749998,"x":0.061829959727065738},{"w":0.62474227905273438,"x":0.12989690160224635,"c":1,"h":0.013081395479069058,"t":"Something else you might be interested in is the boat race along the river.","y":0.85465116272329467},{"t":"SUE:","y":0.87354651173761977,"x":0.059793814461511892,"h":0.0087209299460482281,"w":0.035051546096801757,"c":1},{"y":0.87052260718321306,"w":0.25773195902506507,"c":1,"x":0.12783505131135059,"t":"Oh, yes, do tell me about that.","h":0.01614797416324143},{"y":0.88808139558895205,"w":0.059793815612792948,"c":1,"x":0.059793813739995268,"h":0.010174418083723991,"t":"MARTIN:"},{"y":0.88571372586416797,"w":0.66615259806315108,"h":0.017558865594779927,"c":1,"x":0.11537829483775273,"t":"Ihe race starts at Orford Marina, to the north of Bumham, and goes as far as"},{"w":0.028865979512532558,"h":0.013081395479068947,"x":0.86185566983136253,"y":0.8880813951529074,"c":1,"t":"Q5"},{"c":1,"x":0.1277391975207065,"y":0.90052400022942702,"t":"Summer Pool. The best place to watch it from is Charlesworth Bridge, though that","w":0.69708908081054688,"h":0.018527733180639161},{"t":"does get rather crowded.","c":1,"x":0.12783504776764526,"y":0.92005813957970906,"w":0.21649485270182289,"h":0.01453488361674482},{"t":"Example","h":0.013256304836665178,"y":0.48683114988706788,"c":1,"w":0.07634873708089196,"x":0.86388748701680584},{"c":1,"x":0.91134020644296965,"h":0.013081395479068947,"y":0.94476744175901206,"t":"113","w":0.041237112681070998},{"h":0.022583511809496359,"x":0.35219444028158703,"t":"leltsresources.org","c":1,"y":0.95433624955947682,"w":0.29146217346191411}],"h":3406,"w":2400}